    <string name="privacy_title">How your data is handled</string>
    <string name="privacy_short">Notifications may contain personal information. Notisave stores them only on this device, never uploads them, and never asks for an account. You can delete your history at any time.</string>
    <string name="btn_view_privacy">View Full Privacy Notice</string>
    <string name="privacy_full">Notisave saves copies of the notifications shown on your device so you can read them later, even after they are cleared from the notification panel.\n\n• Notifications are stored only in a local database on this device.\n• Nothing is uploaded to a server, and no account is required.\n• Notifications may contain personal or sensitive information. Anyone with access to this device and this app can read the saved history.\n• Deleted WhatsApp messages can only be shown if they were received as notifications while saving was enabled. Notisave cannot recover messages that were never delivered as notifications, and it does not bypass encryption or access private app databases.\n• You can delete individual notifications or clear all history at any time from the Notifications tab.\n• Turning off notification access stops all saving immediately.</string>
